        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "震卦对应角木蛟，角宿从七度到九度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006422-p000-6006995fb0",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "巽卦对应轸水蚓，轸宿从十度到十三度；戌娄金狗对应奎宿从二度到五度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006423-p000-30dd0ebc76",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "乾卦对应奎木狼，奎宿从六度到八度。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
        "id": "book035-b006424-p000-e9fbf196a8",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "穴位朝向是渐卦变为困卦，穴位归向是归妹卦变为革卦。",
        "confidence": "high",
        "uncertainty": []
      },
      {
